          "prompt": "Read each independent fictional publication/result excerpt and decide whether it meets ALL criteria: put-metric-data specifies namespace Lab/Orders, name QueueDepth, supplied value 7, and exactly Environment=sandbox, Service=orders; only that combination is published; the exercise result associates the value with that complete identity. Do not accept an omitted dimension or a staging result merely because the name matches.",
          "buckets": [
            {
              "bucket_id": "meets",
              "label": "Meets the stated review criteria"
