          "items": [
            {
              "item_id": "i1",
              "text": "```text\naws cloudwatch put-metric-data --namespace Lab/Orders --metric-name QueueDepth --value 7 --dimensions Name=Environment,Value=sandbox Name=Service,Value=orders\nPublication record: displayed publication(s) completed.\nExercise result: value 7 associated with Lab/Orders | QueueDepth | Environment=sandbox, Service=orders.\n```"
            },
            {
              "item_id": "i2",
              "text": "```text\naws cloudwatch put-metric-data --namespace Lab/Orders --metric-name QueueDepth --value 7 --dimensions Name=Environment,Value=sandbox\nPublication record: displayed publication(s) completed.\nExercise result: value 7 associated with Lab/Orders | QueueDepth | Environment=sandbox.\n```"
            },
            {
              "item_id": "i3",
              "text": "```text\naws cloudwatch put-metric-data --namespace Lab/Orders --metric-name QueueDepth --value 3 --dimensions Name=Environment,Value=sandbox Name=Service,Value=orders\nPublication record: displayed publication(s) completed.\nExercise result: value 3 associated with Lab/Orders | QueueDepth | Environment=sandbox, Service=orders.\n```"
            },
            {
              "item_id": "i4",
              "text": "```text\naws cloudwatch put-metric-data --namespace Lab/Orders --metric-name QueueDepth --value 7 --dimensions Name=Environment,Value=sandbox Name=Service,Value=orders\nPublication record: displayed publication(s) completed.\nExercise result: value 7 associated with Lab/Orders | QueueDepth | Environment=staging, Service=orders.\n```"
            },
            {
              "item_id": "i5",
              "text": "```text\naws cloudwatch put-metric-data --namespace Lab/Orders --metric-name QueueDepth --value 7 --dimensions Name=Environment,Value=sandbox Name=Service,Value=orders\naws cloudwatch put-metric-data --namespace Lab/Orders --metric-name QueueDepth --value 3 --dimensions Name=Environment,Value=staging Name=Service,Value=orders\nPublication record: displayed publication(s) completed.\nExercise result: value 7 associated with Lab/Orders | QueueDepth | Environment=sandbox, Service=orders.\n```"
            }
          ]
        },
